{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>KimDrop 讓 iPhone 與電腦連接同一個 Wi-Fi 後，透過瀏覽器雙向傳輸、整理檔案及管理獲授權相片，無需安裝桌面軟件；適合經常在手機與電腦間搬移工作文件、學習資料或旅行相片的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-26.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>瀏覽器雙向傳輸與相片備份</h2>\n<p>連接同一個 Wi-Fi 後，在電腦瀏覽器打開 KimDrop 顯示的網址，即可雙向上下載及整理檔案，無需桌面軟件。你可保留資料夾結構整批上傳，把多個項目下載成 ZIP；亦可篩選相簿、日期或類型，預覽 HEIC 與 Live Photo，並下載原始相片、影片及 Live Photo 的靜態與動態片段，或按月備份手機原始檔案。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-33-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-34-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-35-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-36-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-37-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：KimDrop: Photo &amp; File Transfer</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/kimdrop-photo-file-transfer/id6768211938?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:11.818894+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":360,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:37:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:42.180690+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:13.782704+00:00","content_hash":"584c9736196796e2820ea0f9dba89aba672820cfe960218cedbc8b3c12e09091","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}